OL,3,AJury discharged in Chloe Mitchell
OL,4,Amurder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge in the Chloe Mitchell murder
OL,7,Ftrial has discharged the jury.
OL,9,FThe 21-year-old Ballymena woman went
OL,10,Fmissing in June 2023 and her remains
OL,11,Fwere found days later.
OL,13,FBrandon Rainey, 30, formerly of James
OL,14,FStreet, Ballymena, has denied murdering
OL,15,Fher and preventing the lawful burial of
OL,16,Fher remains.
OL,18,FThe trial began on Wednesday. The trial
OL,19,Fhas been re-listed for the 25 November,
OL,20,Fwhen a new jury will be sworn in.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
